WEBVTT 

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Close-up inside a PC,
showing the fan and motherboard.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.400
The camera slides across
the green board traces.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.300
A rusty metal bracket passes
above the board connectors.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.960
The macro shot highlights
circuits and fine electronic details.
